    {
      "id": "claim_63161f0af3b44da5af9c43ce0b9fad47",
      "statement": "testUtil.TestUtils asserts the exact status, message, and traceLinkType pairing of every response flow via the ResultMessages constants (fresh start RESULT_IS_BEING_PROCESSED, cached start RESULT_IS_READY, not-ready get RESULT_NOT_READY, ready get and ready wait RESULT_IS_READY, timed-out wait REQUEST_TIMED_OUT, start-and-wait timeout REQUEST_TIMED_OUT_START_AND_WAIT), so changing a message constant, a status pairing, or the traceLinkType derivation breaks the controller tests.",
